Version 1.00 would not run with g++ 1.36 on a sun3, despite what i
said. This release DO both compile and run on all the configurations I
have access to (SunOS 4.0.3; sun3, sun4c; g++ 1.36, cfront 1.2 (on
sun3)). I do not think it will compile as-is with g++ 1.37, they seem
to have changed the organization of the include files again.

Oh, btw: myth is a multi-player game with the well known
rogue/larn/hack/moria/omega user interface, in case you have
forgotten. 

Myth is available for anonymous ftp from iesd.auc.dk (129.142.49.1).
Get the file pub/myth-1.01a.tar.Z in binary mode. It is about 300k large.
Please remember that this is an alpha release.

